    prePlaced: []
    swapTokens: 0
    events: []
    intro: 'Bartholomew[happy]: You must be Edith''s grandchild! Bartholomew, bellhop
      since 1923.

      She left you the keys, did she? Then you''re the keeper
      now.

      At midnight the lights come on and the guests arrive. Our job:
      give every ghost a room they like.

      Let me show you. I''ll go first.'
    tutorial:
    - target: queue
      text: Guests wait here. Each card shows what they need.
    - target: card
      text: This is the Guest Card. NEEDS must be met, LIKES earn a bonus star.
    - target: room:101
      text: Captain Morrow needs Water. Drag him into the room with the Water tag.
    - target: open
      text: When everyone has a room, open the doors!
    lockRenovations: 0
